OL,3,GNEWSATravel disruption and power cuts
OL,4,Aafter back-to-back storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne flood warning was in place in Wales
OL,7,Fon Sunday afternoon, at Ely Bridge in
OL,8,FCardiff, while there were nine
OL,9,Fremaining flood alerts at 07:00 GMT on
OL,10,FMonday. Natural Resources Wales (NRW)
OL,11,Fsaid river levels were expected to
OL,12,Ffall.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
